# The wall torch's own fire (README of reports/content/remaster/wall-torch, item 8): the "Red Lantern" torch
# (flame over the head at 406 131 -3086, the wall behind it at +x) at night. Three held views, a shot and a 6 s
# clip of each: along the wall from 1 m, where the dark rock is behind the flame; in front from 1 m, where the wall
# the torch lights is behind it; three-quarter from 3 m. A shot is taken on a later frame, so each is followed by
# a wait before the camera moves. The hero (hidden with the animated draw type) only keeps the place loaded.
# Run it twice: with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT= (the original FIRE_MEDIUM and its flare) and with a content folder made
# by scripts/content/fire/torch_fire_content.py (OWN_TORCH_FLAME, sparks, drops, soot).
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
view hide animated morph
cam lift off

set time 0 0
goto pos 400 -129 -2985
wait 3000
set time 0 0
cam at 405 150 -2985 405 140 -3085
wait 2500
shot side-1m
wait 500
rec side-1m
wait 6000
stop
wait 300
cam at 305 145 -3085 405 140 -3085
wait 2500
shot front-1m
wait 500
rec front-1m
wait 6000
stop
wait 300
cam at 190 120 -2960 405 135 -3085
wait 2500
shot far-3m
wait 500
rec far-3m
wait 6000
stop
wait 300
